<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><title>결제 준비 | Matths 학부모</title><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/images/favicon-32.png" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/brand.css" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/parent.css" /></head>
<body class="parent-page"><%- include('partials/parent-navigation', { activeParentPage: 'pricing' }) %><main class="parent-main parent-checkout-main" id="parent-main"><section class="parent-checkout-card"><p>결제 대상</p><h1><%= child.realName || child.name %> 학생</h1><dl><div><dt>상품</dt><dd><%= product.name %></dd></div><div><dt>이용 기간</dt><dd><%= product.periodLabel %></dd></div><div><dt>결제 예정 금액</dt><dd><strong><%= new Intl.NumberFormat('ko-KR').format(product.amount) %>원</strong></dd></div></dl>
<% if (!intent) { %>
  <section class="checkout-refund-table" aria-labelledby="parent-refund-title"><h2 id="parent-refund-title">결제 전 환불 기준</h2><table><tbody>
    <tr><th>전액 환불</th><td><%= product.refundPolicy.fullRefund %></td></tr>
    <tr><th>부분 환불</th><td><%= product.refundPolicy.partialRefund %><br /><code><%= product.refundPolicy.formula %></code></td></tr>
    <tr><th>신청·처리</th><td><%= product.refundPolicy.application %> <%= product.refundPolicy.processing %></td></tr>
  </tbody></table></section>
  <form method="post" data-parent-guardian-checkout>
    <label><input type="checkbox" required /> 자녀 계정과 상품·금액을 확인했습니다.</label>
    <label class="guardian-consent-check"><input type="checkbox" name="refundPolicyAccepted" value="true" data-refund-policy-consent required /><span>위 상품별 전액·부분 환불 기준, 산식, 신청방법과 3영업일 처리기한을 확인하고 동의합니다.</span></label>
    <section class="guardian-consent-card"><div><small>미성년자 결제 안내</small><strong>법정대리인 동의</strong><p>본인은 위 학생의 법정대리인으로서, 상품·금액·이용 기간을 확인하고 결제 진행에 동의합니다.</p></div><label class="guardian-consent-check"><input type="checkbox" name="legalGuardianConsent" value="true" data-parent-guardian-consent required /><span>법정대리인으로서 결제 동의 내용을 확인했습니다.</span></label></section>
    <button type="submit" data-parent-guardian-submit disabled>결제 계속하기</button>
  </form>
<% } else { %>
  <%- include('partials/inicis-payment-form', { checkoutConfig, amount: intent.amount }) %>
<% } %></section></main>
<script>(() => { const form = document.querySelector('[data-parent-guardian-checkout]'); const guardian = form?.querySelector('[data-parent-guardian-consent]'); const refund = form?.querySelector('[data-refund-policy-consent]'); const submit = form?.querySelector('[data-parent-guardian-submit]'); if (!guardian || !refund || !submit) return; const sync = () => { submit.disabled = !guardian.checked || !refund.checked; }; guardian.addEventListener('change', sync); refund.addEventListener('change', sync); sync(); })();</script>
<%- include("partials/business-footer") %>
</body></html>
